  "description": "Meet Ranger 2.0—a premium, all-terrain e-bike that pairs plush full suspension with confident power and long range. A 750W (95 Nm) rear-hub motor and torque sensor deliver smooth, proportional assist, while the 52V 20Ah battery supports up to 75 miles per charge and 28 mph top speed. 26×4.0″ fat tires, 4-piston hydraulic brakes, and an upgraded DNM rear air shock keep rides stable and comfortable on streets, gravel, and trails. You also get integrated turn signals, a 1000-lumen headlight, a clearer display, and one-touch handlebar controls—built for everyday ease and big-day adventures.\nQuick highlights\n\n750W (95 Nm) motor with torque-sensing assist for natural power.\n\n52V 20Ah LG battery • up to 75 miles range • up to 28 mph top speed.\n\nFull suspension with DNM AO-38RC rear air shock + hydraulic front fork.\n\nTektro HD-E3940 4-piston hydraulic disc brakes for strong, consistent stopping.\n\n26×4.0″ puncture-resistant fat tires for grip and stability off-pavement.\n\nUL 2849 certified system; payload 350 lb; rider height 5'7″–6'6″.\n\nIntegrated turn signals, 1000-lumen headlight, improved display, and bar-mounted controls.",
